From 65d34dd3887fe4ee4025fa03de6ec6f940b76f9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: frogro <frank.grootens@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:16:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH RFC 12/22] thunderbolt: notify display clients before
 retirement and when paths are ready

Pin tunnel/switch/domain lifetime for display events. Deliver the ready notification on the domain ordered queue before DPRX completion and notify the client before retiring a physical DP tunnel. Validate adapter and HPD state before firmware callbacks. This preserves the tested two-sample event debounce, not recurring polling. The synchronous initial replay in this intermediate commit has the Test124 lock inversion; apply the next commit before loading.

Prepared with AI assistance from the recorded local experiments. No maintainer review or DCO sign-off is asserted.
